  "question": {
    "text": "The ratio of number of atoms present in a simple cubic, body centered cubic and face centered cubic structure are, respectively :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>8</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>SC</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>[Atoms are only at the corners]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>BCC</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>[Atoms are at the corners and at the body center]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>FCC</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>[Atoms are at the corners and at the face centers]</p><p>Here,&nbsp;Z=&nbsp;effective number of atoms in the unit cell.</p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>SC</mi></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>BCC</mi></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>FCC</mi></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0043_e25dc4842556.png\" /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0043_8dffffe4c829.png\" /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0043_ad229d5df42c.png\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>SC</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>BCC</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>FCC</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>"
  }
